rties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mapcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Map Color</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ff3300; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">11.02.4128<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 6, 2016<br/>Winter Update 2016</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Deprecated.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20170105184359&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sewing_Table_16b905.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a sewing table.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It has to be magical. The needles and scissors are moving by themselves.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Near <a href=\"#/wiki/Muriel\">Muriel</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32300,32261,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32300, 32261, 7)</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>After using 30 <a href=\"#/wiki/Old%20Rag\">Old Rags</a> on it during Tibia's 20th Anniversary, it would trigger <i>party time</i>, i.e <a href=\"#/wiki/Pi%C3%B1ata%20Dragon\">Piñata Dragons</a> would spawn around <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> and everyone would have an experience bonus of 15% for one hour.<br/>\nWhile using the first 29 <a href=\"#/wiki/Old%20Rag\">Old Rags</a> on it, you would get the following message:<br/>\n<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You are stuffing the empty cuddly dragons with cloth. They are still looking a bit floppy.</span><br/>\nUpon using the 30th <a href=\"#/wiki/Old%20Rag\">Old Rag</a> on it, party time would be triggered and you would get the following message:<br/>\n<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You are stuffing the empty cuddly dragons with cloth. But suddenly they come to live, spring off the table <abbr title=\"Typo: and\">und</abbr> prowl around!</span><br/>\nUpon using any <a href=\"#/wiki/Old%20Rag\">Old Rag</a> on it during party time, you would get the following message:<br/>\n<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">Currently it makes no sense to stuff further dragons. There are already many of them prowling around.</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Old%20Rag\">Old Rag</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pi%C3%B1ata%20Dragon\">Piñata Dragon</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/tibia-anniversary\">Tibia Anniversary</a></li><li>Tibia's 20th Anniversary</li><li>Tools (Objects)</li><li>Utilities</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["tibia-anniversary"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"tibia-anniversary","quest":"Tibia Anniversary","step":"0-1","n":2,"title":"Usar os trapos na Sewing Table","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32300,"y":32261,"z":7,"label":"Sewing Table"}]}],"spots":[{"x":32300,"y":32261,"z":7,"text":"Near Muriel , here ."}]}}